(   [Problem Statement]: A uniform horizontal beam AB of span L = 10 m is simply supported on a pin at A and a roller at B. It carries a uniformly distributed load w = 12 kN/m over the left 6 m, and a concentrated point load P = 40 kN at 8 m from support A. Calculate support reactions at A and B.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Parameters & Free Body Diagram \(FBD\):) Tj
T*
(   - Span length: L = 10.0 m.) Tj
T*
(   - Left support A \(Pin\): Provides horizontal reaction H_A and vertical reaction R_A.) Tj
T*
(   - Right support B \(Roller\): Provides vertical reaction R_B.) Tj
T*
(   - Distributed load: w = 12 kN/m from x = 0 to x = 6 m.) Tj
T*
(   Equivalent concentrated point load W_udl = w * 6 m = 12 * 6 = 72 kN.) Tj
T*
(   Center of gravity of UDL: x_udl = 6 / 2 = 3.0 m from support A.) Tj
T*
(   - Concentrated load: P = 40 kN located at x = 8.0 m from support A.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Moment Equilibrium about Support A \(Sigma M_A = 0, Counterclockwise +\):) Tj
T*
(   Moments creating clockwise rotation \(-\):) Tj
T*
(   M_udl = - \(72 kN * 3.0 m\) = - 216.0 kN-m) Tj
T*
(   M_P = - \(40 kN * 8.0 m\) = - 320.0 kN-m) Tj
T*
(   Moment creating counterclockwise rotation \(+\):) Tj
T*
(   M_RB = + \(R_B * 10.0 m\)) Tj
T*
(   Equilibrium condition:) Tj
T*
(   Sigma M_A = 10.0 * R_B - 216.0 - 320.0 = 0) Tj
T*
(   10.0 * R_B = 536.0 kN-m) Tj
T*
(   R_B = 536.0 / 10.0 = 53.60 kN \(directed vertically upward\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Vertical Force Equilibrium \(Sigma Fy = 0, Upward +\):) Tj
T*
(   R_A + R_B - W_udl - P = 0) Tj
T*
(   R_A + 53.60 - 72.0 - 40.0 = 0) Tj
T*
(   R_A + 53.60 - 112.0 = 0) Tj
T*
(   R_A = 112.0 - 53.60 = 58.40 kN \(directed vertically upward\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Horizontal Force Equilibrium \(Sigma Fx = 0\):) Tj
T*
(   Since all applied forces are strictly vertical and the roller at B cannot resist) Tj
T*
(   horizontal translation, horizontal equilibrium yields: H_A = 0.0 kN.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Final Summary of Support Reactions:) Tj
T*
(   - Pin Reaction at A: R_A = 58.40 kN \(upward\), H_A = 0.0 kN.) Tj
T*
(   - Roller Reaction at B: R_B = 53.60 kN \(upward\).) Tj
T*
(   - Static Check: Total downward load = 72 + 40 = 112 kN; R_A + R_B = 58.40 + 53.60 = 112.0 kN) Tj
T*
(   \(Satisfied\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
