(>> Solution to Question 26:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: A uniform rod AB of length 2 m and weight W = 100 N is hinged at A to a vertical wall and held at 30 degrees to the wall by a horizontal rope attached at end B. Calculate the rope tension and hinge reaction.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Geometry Setup:) Tj
T*
(   Let the vertical wall be the y-axis, with hinge A at \(0, 0\).) Tj
T*
(   Rod AB extends downwards at an angle phi = 30 deg to the vertical wall:) Tj
T*
(   x_B = L * sin\(30 deg\) = 2.0 * 0.500 = 1.0 m) Tj
T*
(   y_B = - L * cos\(30 deg\) = - 2.0 * 0.866 = - 1.732 m) Tj
T*
(   - Weight W = 100 N acts at the center of the rod \(x_cg = 0.50 m, y_cg = - 0.866 m\).) Tj
T*
(   - Horizontal rope attaches at B and pulls horizontally toward the wall with tension T \(directed) Tj
T*
(   to left\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Moment Equilibrium about Hinge A \(Sigma M_A = 0, CCW +\):) Tj
T*
(   - Clockwise moment due to weight W:) Tj
T*
(   M_W = - \(W * x_cg\) = - \(100 N * 0.50 m\) = - 50.0 N-m) Tj
T*
(   - Counterclockwise moment due to rope tension T:) Tj
T*
(   M_T = + \(T * |y_B|\) = + \(T * 1.732 m\)) Tj
T*
(   Equilibrium equation:) Tj
T*
(   1.732 * T - 50.0 = 0) Tj
T*
(   T = 50.0 / 1.732 = 28.87 N.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Calculation of Hinge Reactions at A:) Tj
T*
(   \(a\) Horizontal Equilibrium \(Sigma Fx = 0\):) Tj
T*
(   H_A - T = 0 => H_A = 28.87 N \(directed to the right away from wall\).) Tj
T*
(   \(b\) Vertical Equilibrium \(Sigma Fy = 0\):) Tj
T*
(   R_A - W = 0 => R_A = 100.0 N \(directed vertically upward\).) Tj
T*
(   \(c\) Total Hinge Reaction Magnitude:) Tj
T*
(   R_hinge = sqrt\( H_A^2 + R_A^2 \) = sqrt\( 28.87^2 + 100^2 \) = sqrt\( 833.48 + 10000 \) = 104.08 N.) Tj
T*
(   Angle with horizontal = atan\(100 / 28.87\) = 73.90 degrees.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   Rope tension is T = 28.87 N; Hinge reaction is 104.08 N at 73.90 degrees above horizontal.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

